# Squarespace Compatibility

A shared compatibility library for SERV Squarespace websites.

## Files

### `squarespace-fix.css`

Contains CSS compatibility fixes for Squarespace platform updates.

Currently includes:

- Compatibility with the new `.page-regions > .region` structure
- Backwards compatibility with `.sections` and `#sections`
- Edit mode stacking
- Mobile stacking
- Content wrapper box sizing

### `squarespace-fix.js`

Contains JavaScript compatibility fixes for Squarespace platform updates.

Currently includes:

- `data-current-styles` formatting normalisation

## Usage

Add to Squarespace Header Code Injection:

```html
<!-- Squarespace Compatibility -->
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/codemilk-io/squarespace-scripts@main/squarespace-fix.css">

<script defer src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/codemilk-io/squarespace-scripts@main/squarespace-fix.js"></script>
```

## Changelog

### v1.0.0

- Added Flexbox compatibility for the new `.page-regions` structure
- Added backwards compatibility with `.sections` and `#sections`
- Added edit mode stacking
- Added mobile stacking
- Added `data-current-styles` normalisation
